    id: "**Exoscale**  \nThe portal demonstrator and its backend components are hosted and managed by UdL on its premises. However, to display registered Pontus-X participants, your browser queries the Pontus-X registry, which is managed by deltaDAO AG and hosted on Exoscale servers located in Frankfurt, **Germany** by deltaDAO's hosting provider Akenes SAE. Akenes SAE is headquartered in Boulevard de Grancy 19A, 1006 – Lausanne, **Switzerland**. There is an adequacy decision for Switzerland from the European Commission. deltaDAO's cooperation with Akenes SAE is based on a Data Processing Agreement (DPA). Here you can find Akenes SAE&#39;s current [**DPA** &#8599;](https://www.exoscale.com/dpa/)."
